 11→// Wrap returns the Agent wrapped as an agent.Agent that implements ALL optional
 12→// interfaces (forwarding to the underlying external agent) plus CapabilityDeclarer.
 13→// The As* helpers in the agent package use DeclaredCapabilities() to gate access,
